&oe=6AFDE25E"}, {"file_name": "Main_Custom..._10.03.2026_10-10-07.png", "id": "1314585670535535", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1314585673868868_5095591396090976076_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5SWwFSU380cQ7kNvwEo1JXE&_nc_oc=AdrmGmMarl1ppiCVghrQQou8Lu8Uow0KYNkEnCeZ5DYheoETA6JiCqcJIF5HtuPC_f0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQx4AjzVaXVzBIrwbZS9boL1ji1YsXilIs2LIrZ-a6tSA&oe=6AFDAD34"}, {"file_name": "Main_Custom..._10.03.2026_10-10-27.png", "id": "5062945987300473", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_5062945993967139_3191845456349320077_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_LabUsoV48Q7kNvwHKPqfS&_nc_oc=AdoqnXcjf2bnVbLCh-9XXKoUrl0-P0jeZH43bwMGUMZtkwf91CWSFPOi7lEMSNKmTgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQUqdSnaZXyx82SVXr6sQstRkmYqIhy3NEexIoDI7wkrg&oe=6AFDB889"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "KillianVR", "keywords": ["killian", "movement", "parkour", "hangout", "adventure"], "long_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR! \n\n---Things you can do in KillianVR (So Far)---\n\n- Put both hands on a wall and your camera should \"shift\" to that direction \n\n- Go to the shop located in Forest and buy cosmetics with Bamboo \n\n- You can earn Bamboo by breaking breakables in different maps\n\n- You can access the Menu by pressing the \"X\" button on your left controller\n\n- You can chat with other people and socialize \n\n- NOTE: their is so much more coming to the game, so enjoy!", "short_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Killian", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iFFmMZ-ex7_ULHvjocnEn